          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: On January 25, 2009, around 6:30 PM, a driver observed a red phenomenon with a long trail that lit up the sky. No noise was heard. The witness proceeded to the beach where, like him, other witnesses seemed to have seen the object fall into the sea. No other testimony was collected. All these people were likely witnesses to an atmospheric reentry.",
